      "rationale": "Returns a refusal for a damaged standing baseline generation, a recorded baseline origin with no dataset beside it, an unreadable half or candidate receipt, or a published or task dataset whose identity differs from the recorded memory base. _prepare_and_record calls it before _place_pair, so these known-invalid inputs place no candidate or before half.",
